37
00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:48.351
Cone, Cone, Cone! Scoop, Scoop, Scoop! Sprinkles, Sprinkles, Sprinkles! Vanilla, Vanilla, Vanilla!

38
00:01:48.651 --> 00:01:57.381
Chocolate, Chocolate, Chocolate! Mint, Mint, Mint! Topping, Topping, Topping! Melt, Melt, Melt!

39
00:01:57.681 --> 00:02:00.159
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:13.908
It is a hot day, so Malis goes to the ice cream shop. She wants one scoop of vanilla and one scoop of chocolate in a cone. She adds colourful sprinkles. Eat it quickly before it melts!

41
00:02:14.208 --> 00:02:16.672
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:17.683 --> 00:02:20.080
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:25.040
Chocolate! Well done!

44
00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:28.633
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:31.533 --> 00:02:33.686
Melt! Well done!

46
00:02:34.683 --> 00:02:37.370
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:42.157
Scoop! Well done!

48
00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:44.650
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:47.612
I'd like a vanilla cone, please.

50
00:02:48.412 --> 00:02:49.958
Your turn!

51
00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:55.655
I'd like a vanilla cone, please.

52
00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.545
